r\"/><br/>There Are Four Lights!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/92949-baltimore-the-kiddie-pool-saga-pics-maps-and-links\" target=\"_blank\">[Actual Play] Baltimore: The Kiddie Pool Saga</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/64-figurehead","name":"figurehead","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar64_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"203"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T08:38:15-07:00","id":852988,"title":"","content":"When Reap the Whirlwind came out I remember thinking that <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mWRsgZuwf_8\" target=\"_blank\">Demons</a> by Imagine Dragons (that was kinda everywhere at the time) was very &quot;young kindred badly drama-queening to his... touchstone? girlfriend turned favorite blood doll?&quot; in <b>very obvious</b> ways.<br /> <br /> <br /> [...]and the blood\u2019s run stale<br /> wanna hide the truth<br /> I wanna shelter you<br /> But with the beast inside<br /> There\u2019s nowhere we can hide<br /> [...]<br /> When you feel my heat<br /> Look into my eyes<br /> It\u2019s where my demons hide<br /> [...]<br /> Don\u2019t get too close<br /> It\u2019s dark inside<br /> [...]<br /> Curtain\u2019s call<br /> Is the last of all<br /> When the lights fade out<br /> All the sinners crawl<br /> <br /> So they dug your grave<br /> And the masquerade (I mean really?)<br /> Will come calling out<br /> At the mess you've made<br /> <br /> Don't wanna let you down<br /> But I am hell bound<br /> Though this is all for you<br /> Don't wanna hide the truth<br /> <br /> <br /> Less obvious imagery that is vampire-compatible is incredibly common, really, especially if you go look for it. E. g. Supernatural by Kesha is the umpteenth bog-standard pop song about a girl being super turned on by her dance partner, but it gets really funny in a dark way if you posit that her partner is a Daeva.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1866-ophion","name":"Ophion","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T16:09:41-07:00","id":853214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/850548-songs-that-are-actually-about-vampires?p=851754#post851754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thanks. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I've had to cut back on non-mod forum stuff lately. I badly injured my shoulder, and I've been typing one-handed for a while now. It's a huge pain in the butt.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, sorry to hear that, I can only imagine the discomfort... Hope you get well soon!<br /> <br /> P.S. Loved the little heavier playlist, and saved it in my account too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.greece-bynight.com\" target=\"_blank\">Greece By Night LARP</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/59-stylanski","name":"stylanski","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar59_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"299"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T17:29:57-07:00","id":853241,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>stylanski</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/850548-songs-that-are-actually-about-vampires?p=853214#post853214\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">P.S. Loved the little heavier playlist, and saved it in my account too.</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I really think it needs an In This Moment track, but none of the appropriate ones seem to be on YouTube.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-26T02:12:38-07:00","id":853403,"title":"","content":"If there is a song I can't help but think about Vampire when hearing it, its <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=onXBeQ7aLyk\" target=\"_blank\">All the Right Moves</a>. I just close my eyes and see a masquerade of vampires dancing all the way down a spiral. If there is a song meant to represent what a &quot;Danse Macabre&quot; is, for me it is this one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-27T12:26:40-07:00","id":854146,"title":"","content":"After Midnight by Yuna makes me think of a Kindred more than a little zealous of their touchstone/beloved: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oDeo9CaLVpg\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oDeo9CaLVpg</a><br /> <br /> Beast Within by In this Moment, on the other hand, puts the image of a recently Embraced Daeva, delighted in being a god amongst mortals: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I8bXslAkovQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I8bXslAkovQ</a><br /> <br /> And of course, Swamped by Lacuna Coil. Most of their songs fit nicely as CofD/WoD inspiring music, but this one is forever associated with vampires for me: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ly9E30Hc5pg\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ly9E30Hc5pg</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9109-sidhehound","name":"sidhehound","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9109_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T14:48:57-07:00","id":854686,"title":"","content":"Two quick ones that I always enjoy and that get me in the mood to play:<br /> <br /> Desire by Meg Myers: Always makes me think of a Daeva in the throes of their bane. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bR5u9jb0PJE&amp;ab_channel=MegMyers\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bR5u...annel=MegMyers</a><br /> <br /> I Had This Thing by Royksopp: This one gives me the impression of a vampire reflecting on lost touchstones/humanity. \u200b<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9J_5MchAF_4&amp;ab_channel=R\u00f6yksopp\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9J_5...nnel=R\u00f6yksopp</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1257-kerensky","name":"Kerensky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/ava